      "name": "语音活动检测与切分",
      "definition": "语音活动检测与切分的口径：判定阈值、最短语音段、最大静音切分与尾部保留。",
      "anchor": "https://pypi.org/project/webrtcvad/",
      "anchor_kind": "repo",
      "anchor_status": 200,
      "standard_ref": "w3c-webaudio",
      "standard_why": "关键词「音频|语音|声学|音乐|歌声」命中",
      "standards": [
        {
          "ref": "w3c-webaudio",
          "role": "primary",
          "why": "关键词「音频|语音|声学|音乐|歌声」命中",
          "layer": "form",
          "body": "W3C",
          "reachable": true,
          "http_status": 200,
          "probe_date": "2026-09-24",
          "depends_on": []
        },
        {
          "ref": "w3c-tabular-data",
          "role": "support",
          "why": "A 段载体锚（轮换 1；与主锚异层）",
          "layer": "data",
          "body": "W3C",
          "reachable": true,
          "http_status": 200,
          "probe_date": "2026-09-24",
          "depends_on": [
            "ietf-bcp47"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "check": "声明 vad_threshold、min_speech_ms、max_silence_ms、tail_padding_ms 四个数值。",
      "pitfall": "切分过碎导致识别上下文丢失；尾部静音截断导致尾音丢失。"
    },
    {
      "id": "A04-03",
      "name": "说话人分离与识别",
      "definition": "说话人分离与识别的口径：说话人数量假设、聚类阈值与评测指标（DER / EER）。",
      "anchor": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2003.12687",
      "anchor_kind": "paper",
